---
layout: default.njk
title: "Apps"
permalink: /apps/
---

{#
  Index of self-contained apps under /apps/.

  The list is generated from the "apps" collection in .eleventy.js, which
  globs apps/*/index.html. To add an app here, create apps/<name>/index.html
  with `title`, `summary` and optionally `tech` in its front matter. Nothing
  in this file needs editing.

  Styles are inline because this page is a dozen lines and does not warrant
  its own stylesheet plus a passthrough-copy entry. Apps themselves use the
  `pageCss` front-matter hook instead; see _includes/head.njk.
#}

<style>
  .apps-list { list-style: none; margin: 1.5rem 0 0; padding: 0; }

  .apps-item {
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 1rem 1.15rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.9rem;
    background: #ffffff;
  }

  .apps-item:hover { border-color: #3182ce; }

  .apps-item-title {
    font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 0.3rem;
  }

  .apps-item-title a { color: #3182ce; }

  .apps-item-summary {
    font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: #2d3748;
    line-height: 1.55;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .apps-item-tech {
    font-family: Menlo, Monaco, monospace;
    font-size: 0.74rem;
    color: #718096;
    margin: 0.45rem 0 0;
  }

  .apps-empty {
    font-family: 'Helvetica Neue', 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: #718096;
  }
</style>

<h2 class="section-title">{{ title }}</h2>

<p class="apps-empty">
  Interactive tools. Each one runs entirely in your browser, with no backend
  and no data leaving the page.
</p>

{% if collections.apps | length %}
  <ul class="apps-list">
    {% for app in collections.apps %}
      <li class="apps-item">
        <h3 class="apps-item-title">
          <a href="{{ app.url }}">{{ app.data.title }}</a>
        </h3>
        {% if app.data.summary %}
          <p class="apps-item-summary">{{ app.data.summary }}</p>
        {% endif %}
        {% if app.data.tech %}
          <p class="apps-item-tech">{{ app.data.tech }}</p>
        {% endif %}
      </li>
    {% endfor %}
  </ul>
{% else %}
  <p class="apps-empty">Nothing here yet.</p>
{% endif %}
